# ─── Shopify CLI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine-local CLI state: the dev/deploy bundles, the linked dev store, the
# app's hidden config. Regenerated on every `shopify app dev` / `app deploy`,
# never the same between two developers.
.shopify/

# ─── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `shopify app dev` walks the whole app root and runs `<pm> install` in every
# directory that has a package.json, so node_modules can appear at more than
# one depth — hence the unanchored pattern.
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/versions

# ─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The CLI writes the app's client secret and dev URLs into .env on first run.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# sje-shoppable-scripts is a Vite project. Its *widget* build is NOT here:
# build.mjs writes sje-carousel.js / sje-stories.js straight into
# extensions/shoppable-videos/assets/, and those files must stay tracked —
# `shopify app deploy` uploads the assets directory verbatim, with no build
# step of its own. Only the leftovers of a plain `vite build` / `vite preview`
# are ignored here.
sje-shoppable-scripts/dist/
sje-shoppable-scripts/dist-ssr/
sje-shoppable-scripts/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.sw?
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.local
.cache/
tmp/
